OL,3,GNEWSARunner chased by man in balaclava
OL,4,Arefuses to give up
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the clocks go back and evenings
OL,7,Fbecome darker, many runners face a
OL,8,Fdilemma: stick to the routes they enjoy
OL,9,For change their habits because they do
OL,10,Fnot feel safe.
OL,12,FScarlett Ward refused to let fear make
OL,13,Fthat decision for her.
OL,15,FAfter being chased while out on a run,
OL,16,Fshe was determined not to give up a
OL,17,Fhobby that had become an important part
OL,18,Fof her life.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
