OL,3,GNEWSARunner chased by man in balaclava
OL,4,Arefuses to give up
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They attack you twice if they make you
OL,7,Fgive up what you want to do, especially
OL,8,Fsomething you're passionate about,"
OL,9,Fsaid the runner, from
OL,10,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, Staffordshire.
